### Scenario 2 - GOLD customer with MEGA25: the 30% discount cap kicks in
### Cart: 1 x ELC-3002 (89.00) + 1 x HOM-4001 (34.90) = 123.90 HT
### tier 10% = 12.39, MEGA25 would be 27.88 -> cap = 37.17, so the promo is reduced to 24.78
### Expected: goodsHt = 86.73, goodsTtc = 104.08, discountCapApplied = true

@order = http://localhost:8083

### 1. Create the cart
# @name cart
POST {{order}}/carts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": 1 }

### 2. Add the items
POST {{order}}/carts/{{cart.response.body.id}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "ELC-3002", "qty": 1 }

###
POST {{order}}/carts/{{cart.response.body.id}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "HOM-4001", "qty": 1 }

### 3. Cart estimate (no promo, no shipping)
GET {{order}}/carts/{{cart.response.body.id}}

### 4. Checkout with the promo
# @name checkout
POST {{order}}/carts/{{cart.response.body.id}}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "shippingMethod": "STANDARD", "promoCode": "MEGA25" }

### The promo usage is consumed for good
GET http://localhost:8081/promotions/validate?code=MEGA25
